<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 26-FEB.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 26-FEB.</headline>
<text>
<p>A disturbance tracking by the North West Cape of Australia is likely causing rough seas and wind today. This is of minor risk to shipping during this period. It has winds of 30-35 mph as it tracks by but it may strengthen some during the period.  </p>
<p>There are no emergency statements at this time.  </p>
<p>There are no emergence statements at this time.</p>
</text>
